= 0.0 makes the bust bucket a point mass at the $0 floor, so the 10th percentile
of the mixture is exactly 0 whenever p_bust >= 0.10 -- true for 99.60% of served
active rows. Measured: band_p10_mm == 0.0 on 4470 of 4477 (99.84%), and
band_p10_mm == band_p90_mm (a zero-width "band") on 1103 (24.64%).
This patch adds a non-degenerate companion; it does NOT change any existing key.
GATED: serving it is a display-contract decision for the owner.
=============================================================================
